s, key) {\n            Array::push(str_strs, key)\n          }\n          add_map_keys_expr(val)\n          mi = mi + 1\n        }\n      },\n      EStringInterp(parts) => {\n        let mut pi3 = 0\n        while pi3 < Array::length(parts) {\n          if pi3 % 2 == 0 {\n            let part = Array::get(parts, pi3)\n            if String::length(part) > 0 && !array_contains_str(str_strs, part) {\n              Array::push(str_strs, part)\n            }\n          }\n          pi3 = pi3 + 1\n        }\n      },\n      ELet(_, val, body) => {\n        add_map_keys_expr(val); add_map_keys_expr(body)\n      },\n      ELetMut(_, val, body) => {\n        add_map_keys_expr(val); add_map_keys_expr(body)\n      },\n      ELetRec(_, val, body) => {\n        add_map_keys_expr(val); add_map_keys_expr(body)\n      },\n      ESeq(a, b) => {\n        add_map_keys_expr(a); add_map_keys_expr(b)\n      },\n      EIf(c, t, e) => {\n        add_map_keys_expr(c); add_map_keys_expr(t); add_map_keys_expr(e)\n      },\n      EFn(_, _, _, _, _, body) => add_map_keys_expr(body),\n      EHandle(body, _) => add_map_keys_expr(body),\n      ECall(callee, args) => {\n        add_map_keys_expr(callee)\n        let mut ai = 0\n        while ai < Array::length(args) {\n          add_map_keys_expr(Array::get(args, ai))\n          ai = ai + 1\n        }\n      },\n      _ => ()\n    }\n  }\n  let mut __mk = 0\n  while __mk < Array::length(stmts) {\n    match Array::get(stmts, __mk) {\n      SLet(_, _, _, _, expr) => add_map_keys_expr(expr),\n      STest(_, expr) => add_map_keys_expr(expr),\n      SBench(_, expr) => add_map_keys_expr(expr),\n      _ => ()\n    }\n    __mk = __mk + 1\n  }\n  if !array_contains_str(str_strs, \"\") {\n    Array::push(str_strs, \"\")\n  }\n  let src_str_base = Array::length(str_strs)\n  let num_src_pairs = Array::length(selfhost_srcs)\n  let mut __src_i = 0\n  while __src_i < num_src_pairs {\n    let (__src_path, __src_content) = Array::get(selfhost_srcs, __src_i)\n    A